<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #111827; line-height: 1.5; padding: 20px;">
  <h2>Invitation to join {{.org_name}} on kr0n</h2>
  <p>You have been invited to join <strong>{{.org_name}}</strong> on kr0n with role <code>{{.role_id}}</code>.</p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="http://localhost:3000/invites/accept?token={{.token}}" style="background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block;">Accept Invitation</a>
  </p>
  <p style="color: #4b5563; font-size: 13px;">Or copy and paste this invitation URL into your browser:<br/>
    <a href="http://localhost:3000/invites/accept?token={{.token}}" style="color: #2563eb; word-break: break-all;">http://localhost:3000/invites/accept?token={{.token}}</a>
  </p>
  <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">Invitation Token: <code style="background: #f3f4f6; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px;">{{.token}}</code></p>
  <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">If you did not expect this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>
